cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Methylome.Plants: A Comprehensive Pipeline for Plant Whole-Genome Methylome Analysis"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Yerushalmy
    given-names: Yonatan
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-2671-2457"

  - family-names: Hacham
    given-names: Yael

  - family-names: Amir
    given-names: Rachel

abstract: >-
  Methylome.Plants is an R- and shell-based pipeline for downstream analysis
  of plant whole-genome DNA methylation data. It supports WGBS, Nanopore
  bedMethyl, and CGmap inputs and integrates methylation quality control,
  differential methylation analysis, genomic and transposable-element
  annotation, visualization, functional enrichment, and automated reporting.

keywords:
  - methylome
  - plants
  - differential methylation
  - DMRs
  - metaplots
  - functional enrichment
  - genome annotation
  - bioinformatics

repository-code: "https://github.com/Yo-yerush/Methylome.Plants"

